    "causal_summary": "mcp-browser-use is the single public advisor identity for three browser modes. mcp-chrome-devtools covers inspection and debugging through bdg, plus Lighthouse audits and performance traces through the Chrome DevTools MCP. mcp-aside-devtools covers deterministic signed-in REPL proof and captured REPL evidence. mcp-bladebro covers stealth browsing, agentic branching and work in a caller-owned browser. The hub holds no per-mode logic: hub-router.json selects the mode, and mode-registry.json maps it to its packet. Generic browser-automation and bare agentic-browser phrasing defers instead of fanning out. The modes share mcp-code-mode as external infrastructure.",
